---
---

<section class="w-full bg-background py-16 md:py-24 border-b border-outline" id="casos-estudio">
	<div class="container-page">
		<div class="mb-14 max-w-[44rem]">
			<span class="mb-2 inline-block font-caption text-caption font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent">
				Resultados y Métricas Comprobadas
			</span>
			<h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-primary">
				Proyectos que multiplicaron su velocidad comercial con Montara
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 font-body-md text-body-md text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
				Desarrolladores que confiaron su estrategia de venta a nuestra plataforma digital.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mb-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
			<!-- Caso 1: Finca Sevilla -->
			<div class="flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-outline bg-surface shadow-level-1 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-level-2">
				<div class="relative h-72 w-full overflow-hidden bg-primary">
					<img
						src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuBAll3zL92x0e7cCvbck9VyCmL6YtcVcpChRueniWh-C41CBPqRwsOhxdAXaXxwhJR1BJCh6juWdv0bSvJWZYoSBM3uLa-vn8-4xOZyT6CLTC_TejkQ197KSZP6cpbw8qSy1H9xwNBjnyWM8Y1sdbHkeG9JxCLxatCpoeP1qoyqhRc1O1KS8w7VhIOUy7KTxXzb9vGnS9kKyvge-j3xHju3d9WJwHv-5mDzfNXz8Jvee2uHwgwsG-3LrA"
						alt="Vista panorámica de Finca Sevilla"
						class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105"
						loading="lazy"
					/>
					<div class="absolute left-4 top-4">
						<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-pill bg-white/95 px-3 py-1 font-caption text-caption font-bold text-accent shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">
							<span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse"></span>
							Showroom Activo
						</span>
					</div>
					<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-primary/85 p-3 text-white backdrop-blur-md">
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-white/60">Tipología</span>
							<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold">Lotes de Campo & Quintas</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-right">
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-white/60">Ubicación</span>
							<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold">Chiclayo, Perú</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-8">
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-primary">
							Finca Sevilla: Captación de Alta Solvencia
						</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
							Desarrollo campestre que integró croquis interactivo por etapas. Permitió captar inversionistas de Chiclayo y Lima sin necesidad de desplazamiento físico inicial, cerrando separaciones directas.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Métricas caso 1 -->
					<div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-tinted p-4 text-center sm:text-left">
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-caption text-text-muted">Absorción</span>
							<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-accent">+62%</span>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-text-muted">en primeros 90 días</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-caption text-text-muted">Leads Calificados</span>
							<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-primary">420+</span>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-text-muted">con scoring &gt;80</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-caption text-text-muted">Costo por Reserva</span>
							<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-accent">-45%</span>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-text-muted">vs. pauta tradicional</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Caso 2: Residencial Los Álamos -->
			<div class="flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden rounded-card border border-outline bg-surface shadow-level-1 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-level-2">
				<div class="relative h-72 w-full overflow-hidden bg-primary">
					<img
						src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDC1ru2DxWP3l6GiBh9EWlh1pQebZ8rV2NdSiXh17Ohz4uHhgtG575QOPYz8jGlmjYyEuv5iEo5XbRsrYOXH5dndZpAxotMp-7UUWAPDZbjsIzavGfQZWNSRf7SiLEXPg4u_mT5aMro2NExGFhrOzk8CbFUGzncMd74VW3M3h8E4yHVZwv8ORtowH-qIQfdTPm0tQCCvXgr-Bu-vy1zGOTp0RXoJa3EZJxE824GJYPv-q0oX1j6W7z0hQ"
						alt="Edificio residencial Residencial Los Álamos"
						class="h-full w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 hover:scale-105"
						loading="lazy"
					/>
					<div class="absolute left-4 top-4">
						<span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-pill bg-white/95 px-3 py-1 font-caption text-caption font-bold text-accent shadow-sm backdrop-blur-md">
							<span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent animate-pulse"></span>
							Showroom Activo
						</span>
					</div>
					<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl bg-primary/85 p-3 text-white backdrop-blur-md">
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-white/60">Tipología</span>
							<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold">Departamentos & Penthouses</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-right">
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-white/60">Ubicación</span>
							<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-semibold">Zona Consolidada</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between p-6 md:p-8">
					<div>
						<h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-primary">
							Residencial Los Álamos: Visualizador de Planos
						</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 font-body-md text-body-md leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
							Proyecto multifamiliar que reemplazó catálogos impresos por un visualizador interactivo de plantas y vistas por piso, reduciendo el ciclo de decisión de semanas a días.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Métricas caso 2 -->
					<div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 rounded-xl bg-surface-tinted p-4 text-center sm:text-left">
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-caption text-text-muted">Preventa</span>
							<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-accent">85%</span>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-text-muted">vendido en etapa 1</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-caption text-text-muted">Tiempo Ciclo</span>
							<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-primary">12 días</span>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-text-muted">contacto a firma</span>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span class="block font-caption text-caption text-text-muted">Satisfacción</span>
							<span class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm font-bold text-accent">9.8/10</span>
							<span class="block font-caption text-[11px] text-text-muted">experiencia del cliente</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Testimonial Institucional de Desarrollador -->
		<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-8 rounded-card border border-outline bg-surface-tinted p-8 md:flex-row md:p-10">
			<div class="h-20 w-20 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full border-2 border-accent shadow-md">
				<img
					src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuB6uYFQ5xsnVCy6SLlMqV2sPwd7ep9epiCl-0LJBgQEFcR7SPmV6LaDKnpvHQo0ZKPhHlKVgEGhAnJzIi7zQb1rjanEFyaOmRXX7ZM15blipm3dYewqCHyw_Y0pWrXjQqeFZx5KslzHzErEb1OZh1Tmy8bZEyMOj_r7HIQbuf9aauH51xhXGqOdaFN5ZAXBIJt954O-IayiOvCGpLMGE1_NHR8FbNzHhcqO8JDVnBt7YvAkMY0gVqN8Hw"
					alt="Retrato profesional del Ing. Roberto Santisteban"
					class="h-full w-full object-cover"
					loading="lazy"
				/>
			</div>

			<div class="flex-1 space-y-2 text-center md:text-left">
				<div class="flex justify-center gap-1 text-accent md:justify-start">
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">star</span>
				</div>
				<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg italic leading-relaxed text-text">
					"Montara cambió por completo la forma en que presentamos Finca Sevilla. Dejamos de atender llamadas vacías de curiosos en redes; hoy nuestros asesores se sientan directamente con inversionistas que ya vieron el lote en el showroom y tienen el monto de separación listo."
				</p>
				<div class="pt-2">
					<span class="font-title-md text-title-md font-bold text-primary block">Ing. Roberto Santisteban</span>
					<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-text-muted">Director de Proyectos — Grupo Inmobiliario del Norte</span>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
